==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~12 seconds<sup>60f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Since this is usually the first appearance of a metal enemy to many players, using quick-attacking cats (like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]]) will make this level a breeze. Metal enemies only take 1 damage from any hit; that's why using quick-attacking cats will make short work of the Metal Hippoe. Spamming Giraffe Cats is a great idea. After that, proceed to destroy the enemy base.

